  "details": "The new Avatars menu design no longer aligns with the visual and functional layout of the other tabs - like Worlds, Social, Groups, VRC+, Marketplace, Notifications, Help & Info, and Settings. \n\nIn fact, it's now the only tab that breaks from the established UI style.\n\nWhat used to be a clean and consistent layout now feels unfinished and out of place. The design doesn't match the rest of the menus and makes the UI feel messy and inconsistent.\n\nPlease consider giving the Avatars menu some love to bring it back in line with the rest of the UI.",
